<title>USA: Theragenics sets stockholder rights plan.</title>
<headline>Theragenics sets stockholder rights plan.</headline>
<dateline>NORCROSS, Ga. 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Theragenics Corp said on Tuesday it adopted a stockholders' rights plan to protect the company from &quot;coercive, unfair and inadequate takeover bids and practices.&quot;</p>
<p>The plan is triggered when someone acquires 20 percent or more of the company's common stock.</p>
<p>Theragenics makes a product used in the treatment of prostate cancer.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
